<ServiceLayout title="Headaches & Migraines" description="Chiropractic treatment for headaches and migraines at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>If you suffer from recurring headaches or migraines, you know how debilitating they can be. Research shows that spinal manipulation — the primary treatment chiropractors provide — can be an effective approach for tension headaches and headaches that originate in the neck.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>The spine-headache connection</h2>
<p>Many headaches, including migraines, are related to tension and misalignment in the cervical spine. When vertebrae in the neck are out of alignment, they can irritate nerves and restrict blood flow, triggering headache pain. This is especially common in people who spend long hours sitting, working at a computer, or looking down at a phone.</p>
<h2>How we can help</h2>
<p>Through careful chiropractic adjustments, we can improve spinal function and alleviate the stress on your nervous system. Many of our headache patients report significant reductions in both the frequency and intensity of their headaches. We also provide guidance on posture, ergonomics, and lifestyle factors that may contribute to your headaches.</p>
</ServiceLayout>
